{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"aa1b925988838e1371bb072e339379f03dcec5f83d41111f9f14f58e31d5e89e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["葡萄树的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华的话临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，葡萄树比别样树有什么强处？葡萄枝比众树枝有什么好处？"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["其上可以取木料做什么工用，可以取来做钉子挂什么器皿吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["看哪，已经抛在火中当作柴烧，火既烧了两头，中间也被烧了，还有益于工用吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["完全的时候尚且不合乎什么工用，何况被火烧坏，还能合乎什么工用吗？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所以，主耶和华如此说：「众树以内的葡萄树，我怎样使它在火中当柴，也必照样待耶路撒冷的居民。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我必向他们变脸；他们虽从火中出来，火却要烧灭他们。我向他们变脸的时候，你们就知道我是耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我必使地土荒凉，因为他们行事干犯我。这是主耶和华说的。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}